{"id":"n3-050","title":"～てはじめて (〜te hajimete)","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Realization or action done for the first time; 'only after', 'not until'.","longExplanation":"The ～てはじめて grammar point indicates that something is realized or happens for the first time only after another action is completed. It can be translated as 'only after' or 'not until'.","formation":"Verb-て form + はじめて","examples":[{"jp":"海外に行ってはじめて、日本の良さが分かりました。","romaji":"Kaigai ni itte hajimete, Nihon no yosa ga wakarimashita.","en":"Only after going abroad did I realize how great Japan is.","words":[{"surface":"海外","vocabId":"1201260","reading":"かいがい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行っ","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"はじめ","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ","baseForm":"はじめる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にほん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"良","vocabId":"1957070","reading":"りょう","baseForm":"良い"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"分かり","vocabId":"1502940","reading":"わかり","baseForm":"分かる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"彼女と別れてはじめて、彼女の大切さに気づいた。","romaji":"Kanojo to wakarete hajimete, kanojo no taisetsusa ni kizuita.","en":"I realized her importance only after breaking up with her.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"別れ","vocabId":"1509490","reading":"わかれ","baseForm":"別れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"はじめ","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ","baseForm":"はじめる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"大切","vocabId":"1414340","reading":"たいせつ"},{"surface":"さ","voc